s en soepele gameplay.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"443\">De game staat bekend om zijn handgetekende stijl en perfecte balans tussen toegankelijkheid en uitdaging, waardoor hij geschikt is voor spelers van alle leeftijden.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"448\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"461\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"480\"><strong data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"480\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"485\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"502\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n<li data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"543\">\r\n<p data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"543\">🎮 Geschikt voor solo en multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"580\">\r\n<p data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"580\">🌈 Unieke handgetekende graphics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"613\">🎵 Creatieve muzikale levels</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"654\">\r\n<p data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"654\">🕹️ Soepele en responsieve besturing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n<p data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"692\">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Leuk voor jong en oud</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"697\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"719\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"904\">\r\n<li data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"742\">\r\n<p data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"742\">Platform: Xbox One</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"766\">\r\n<p data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"766\">Genre: Platformgame</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"799\">\r\n<p data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"799\">Spelers: 1–4 lokaal / online</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"834\">\r\n<p data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"834\">Taal: Meertalig (incl. Engels)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"856\">\r\n<p data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"856\">Uit